      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سهّدهُ</span></b> , (S, A, L, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْهِيدٌ</span>; (PS;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسهدهُ</span></b> ; (A, TA;) <i>He,</i> (a man, S, L, K,)
and it, (anxiety, or grief, A, L, and pain, L,)
<i>rendered him sleepless.</i> (S, A, L, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسْهَّدُ</span> <i>Such a one is not suffered to sleep.</i> (L.)

